# Copilot Agent Mode — DA landing UI (Catalog Search + Intelligent DA)

Frontend-only task. Backend API already exists — integrate it, do not build it. Follow every rule. Stop and report if any rule cannot be met.

## Rules (non-negotiable)
- Product name, UI copy, and routes: use **DA** only — never its long form. Gateway and marketplace: use **Tach** only — never its long form. Applies to code, copy, and identifiers.
- Sources are exactly: `IDP`, `Tach Agent Marketplace`, `Enterprise Git`.
- Light theme only. Use existing design tokens/components. Do not add UI frameworks.
- No hardcoded API base URLs, tokens, or secrets. Read from existing config/env.
- Preserve existing auth/session handling. Keep diffs small and typed.

## Stack
React + Vite + TypeScript. Data fetching via the repo's existing query/cache layer.

## API it consumes (already live — client + types only)
- `GET /api/da/search` → `{ items: Entity[], total, facetCounts }` — params `q, type, source[], lifecycle[], owner, sort, page, pageSize`.
- `GET /api/da/entities/{id}` → entity + resolved `dependsOn` + reverse `usedBy`.
- `GET /api/da/stats` → KPI counters + 7-day sparkline series.
- `POST /api/da/ask` → `{ summary, matches: Entity[], sources, estimatedSavingsDays, grounded }`.

`Entity`:
```ts
type Entity = {
  id: string;
  type: "component" | "prompt" | "repo" | "api" | "agent";
  source: "Enterprise Git" | "Tach Agent Marketplace" | "IDP";
  lifecycle: "production" | "beta" | "experimental";
  owner: string;
  language: string;
  description: string;
  tags: string[];
  reuseCount: number;
  growth7d: number;
  updatedAt: string;
  dependsOn: string[];
  install: string;
  sparkline: number[];
};
```

## App shell
- Left sidebar: brand + `UAT` badge; `⌘K` trigger; nav "Browse" (All, Components, Prompts, Repositories, APIs, Agents — each with a live count) + "Saved views" (Trending now, Most reused, My components) + "Workspace" (Playbook Store, Insights); user pinned bottom.
- Top bar: breadcrumb `Catalog / <view>`, `Export`, `Register`.
- Sidebar → drawer under 960px. Table → stacked rows under 680px.

## Mode switch (top of content, required)
- Segmented control: `🔍 Catalog Search` (default) and `✨ Intelligent DA`.
- A query typed in Catalog carries into Intelligent DA and auto-asks via the `✨ AI` affordance.
- Any sidebar nav/saved view returns to Catalog Search.

## Catalog Search
- KPI strip with sparklines from `GET /api/da/stats`.
- Toolbar: search (180ms debounce, subsequence fuzzy + match highlight); Source and Lifecycle facets; Sort (`trending|reuse|recent|az`); Table/Cards toggle.
- Removable active-filter pills + Clear all.
- Table columns: Name (icon+id+desc), Type, Owner (avatar), Source, Lifecycle, Reuse (+sparkline), Trend (▲%), Updated, row actions (`Copy`, `Reuse`). Sortable headers. Cards view alternative.
- Row/card → right slide-over: description; actions `Reuse` / `Open in IDE` / `View source` / `Add to project`; copyable install command; metadata grid; navigable `Depends on` + `Used by`.

## Intelligent DA
- Centered ask input + `Ask` + 3–4 example prompts.
- On ask: skeleton → answer from `POST /api/da/ask`: summary, "reuse instead of build — est. N dev-days saved" callout, "grounded in N matches · <sources>" line, matched entity cards (first = `Best match`). Cards open the slide-over.
- `grounded: false`: state it was logged to the gap backlog; offer to draft a spec.

## Command palette (`⌘K` / `Ctrl+K`)
- Fuzzy search over entities + commands (switch mode, filter by type, sort trending, reset, export). Keyboard nav ↑/↓/↵/esc, grouped, highlighted, empty state. `/` focuses catalog search.

## Cross-cutting
- Every async surface: loading (skeleton), empty, and error states.
- Dialogs (palette, slide-over) get roles + focus management; visible focus rings; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Add component tests for: mode switch + context carry-over, fuzzy filter/highlight, facet + sort behavior, slide-over dependency navigation, palette keyboard nav.

## Acceptance gate (all must pass)
- [ ] Landing shows Catalog Search + Intelligent DA; Catalog default; context carries between them.
- [ ] Sidebar shell with live counts + responsive drawer.
- [ ] Catalog: fuzzy search + highlight, facets, sort, Table/Cards, filter pills, slide-over with navigable deps.
- [ ] Intelligent DA: renders grounded answer + best-match cards; `grounded:false` → gap-backlog message.
- [ ] `⌘K` palette: entities + commands, full keyboard nav.
- [ ] Loading/empty/error + a11y on every async surface; tests green.
- [ ] New code and copy use only **DA** and **Tach** — no long-form name appears anywhere.

## Do not
No dark theme. No new UI framework. No backend/API changes. No new auth. No renaming unrelated modules. No committed secrets.
